  The reel_script and caption say the arrest took place in Thiruvarur on Nov 15 and that the man was produced before Thiruvarur Town police station; the article says he was arrested in Thiruvarur and produced at Town police station, which matches, so no issue there. However, the reel_script states the judge inspected Manali police station and found Sivaraman there but the draft also says the lawyers' protest concerns 'விதிமீறல்' without the article naming the lawyer group leader Thondan Subramani, which is a missing key fact (who led the protest).
